
### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Login
# @name Login
POST http://localhost:8888/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get Profile (需要先登录获取 token)
@token = {{Login.response.body.data.access_token}}
###
GET http://localhost:8888/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8888/upload/image/ff46e659-b789-416f-ae08-e5b0d706db88.png
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8888/room-type?hotelId=a7c5a01e-747d-4607-9310-9636cd17bf0f
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




